<overview>
<p>Conventional infantry within the DCMS serve as the foundation of planetary defense, providing the manpower essential to territorial control while freeing BattleMech and armored assets for offensive operations. The platoon tows a light autocannon that can engage armored targets at long range with accurate, sustained fire. What it lacks in raw damage per shot, it compensates for with reach and rate of fire, keeping the crew well beyond the effective range of most infantry weapons directed back at them.</p>
</overview>

<notes>
Intro date based on prototype date of DCMS armor kit
